case3=pagehead(root,'Learning & support','Making complicated things <span class="serif highlight">feel possible.</span>','Practical explanations, encouragement and support for beginners learning digital marketing.',True)+f'''<section class="section container case-layout"><article class="case-main"><h2>The context</h2><p>People starting in digital marketing encounter terminology, unfamiliar dashboards and numerous claims about results. Clear communication matters just as much as technical knowledge.</p><h2>My contribution</h2><p>Through community conversations and independent coaching, I helped learners understand digital product marketing basics, how to approach potential customers and how to get started with online learning tools.</p><p>The supplied chat screenshots contain positive private feedback from someone who received guidance. I have not published their personal message or identity on this website without permission.</p><div class="insight"><strong>My approach:</strong> Answer the question in plain language, check that the explanation is understood, and create room for follow-up.</div><h2>Where this experience fits</h2><p>These skills translate naturally into customer success, onboarding, support documentation, community operations and beginner-friendly education programmes.</p><p>For future roles, I want to improve my structured ticketing, documentation and customer satisfaction reporting skills while applying the people-first skills I already use.</p></article><aside class="case-aside"><dl><dt>Area</dt><dd>Community education & onboarding</dd><dt>Format</dt><dd>Peer guidance and group-based learning</dd><dt>Audience</dt><dd>Beginners in digital marketing</dd><dt>Skills</dt><dd>Clear writing, empathy, explanations, follow-up</dd><dt>Proof policy</dt><dd>Private testimonials not published without consent</dd></dl></aside></section>'''
